  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "My world was banned, but why was a 3-day user ban also applied without any prior warning?\n\nFrom my perspective, simply deleting the world and banning the user without explaining the reason looks like negligence on the staff’s part.\n\nI have also heard that decisions may be made only by looking at the contents of reports, but are these cases truly being reviewed properly?\n\nAt the very least, I think there should be some kind of warning first.\n\nAre creators expected to simply accept the risk of being banned when making worlds?\n\nIf this situation does not improve, then as a creator, I will hesitate to continue making content at all.",
